Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.12,0:00:11.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}克拉克森的农场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.32,0:00:17.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二十一集 治愈
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was now early April.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.80,0:00:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在是四月初
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And after the misery of all the pig deaths,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在经历了猪崽死亡的痛苦之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:40.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the arrival of spring gave everyone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.28,0:00:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}春天的到来让大家欢欣鼓舞
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a much-needed lift.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at it! It's lovely! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.08,0:00:51.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你看 真可爱 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:54.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pig, pig, pig, pig.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.88,0:00:54.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}猪猪!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We could also now get back to the business of planting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.60,0:01:06.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在也可以回到 种植、栽种和制作食物的工作了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.52,0:01:07.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and growing and making food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:10.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I fired up the Lambo,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:10.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我启动了兰博基尼
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:14.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because I'd had another farming the unfarmed brainwave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:14.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我有了另一个耕种非耕地的点子
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All over the farm, there are splodges of land like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.00,0:01:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}整个农场到处都是这样的土地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}an acre here, two acres there and so on,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:31.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里一英亩 那里两英亩等等
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:35.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which, over the years, I've used to grow maize, mostly,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.72,0:01:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些年来 我主要用这些土地种植玉米
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is great for the songbirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.44,0:01:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这有益于鸣禽的生存
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's good food for them and it's somewhere for them to hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.28,0:01:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}玉米地不仅能给它们提供食物 还能提供藏身之地
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's also been quite useful for the pheasants
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.28,0:01:43.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且玉米地对我饲养的 会在圣诞期间射杀的野鸡而言
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:46.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that I rear to shoot at Christmas time, but we'll gloss over that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.48,0:01:46.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}也非常有用 但我们就不深究了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.12,0:01:51.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But instead of maize,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.12,0:01:51.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我不准备
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}what I'm going to plant in here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.08,0:01:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}再在这里种玉米了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:55.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is mustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我要种芥菜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:59.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Still great for the songbirds. They love eating it and hiding in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.96,0:01:57.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}仍然有益于鸣禽的生存
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.40,0:01:59.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们喜欢吃 也喜欢藏身其中
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then I can turn it into English mustard
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 我可以把它做成英式芥末酱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.88,0:02:04.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which I can sell in the shop
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.88,0:02:04.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不仅可以在商店销售
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:08.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and in the burger van as an accompaniment to my pork.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.88,0:02:08.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还可以拿去汉堡车 做我的猪肉的佐料
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}By my maths,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.12,0:02:12.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}根据我的计算 这一块小小的区域
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:15.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}this one little patch here is going to generate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.24,0:02:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}能生产出四万罐芥末酱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.44,0:02:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}40,000 jars of mustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:23.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The only problem with that is that every single bit of maths
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.04,0:02:23.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}唯一的问题是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've done over the last four years on the farm
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.00,0:02:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在过去四年里 我在这座农场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:29.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}has turned out to be wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.28,0:02:29.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}做的所有计算都被证明是错的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:35.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Meanwhile, Kaleb was busy in one of the other fields,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.40,0:02:35.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}与此同时 卡莱布正忙着 耕种其他田地
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as the soil was finally dry enough for him to plant his durum wheat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土壤终于干燥到能种硬质小麦了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, winter wheat is roughly about £340 a tonne at the moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.32,0:02:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 目前冬小麦大约每吨340英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is basically your breads and your doughs, etc.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.80,0:02:50.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}基本上会被用来做面包和面团等
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But this wheat is a spring crop and it's basically your pastas.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.64,0:02:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这种小麦是春季作物
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:57.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's worth about £500 a tonne,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.04,0:02:57.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}基本上是拿来做意面的 每吨价值大约500英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so there's a massive difference between the two.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.20,0:02:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这两个品种之间差距很大
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think I'm about a month late because of that March rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.76,0:03:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我种晚了一个月 因为三月的那场雨
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It just never stopped raining.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.64,0:03:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一直下个不停
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:10.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm hoping, fingers crossed,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:10.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我希望 并且祈祷
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:13.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that it doesn't affect the yields and it'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.40,0:03:13.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不会影响收成 希望一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:17.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is fun, isn't it? Some tractor driving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.84,0:03:17.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这很有趣吧?又开始开拖拉机了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I know. I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.44,0:03:19.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 我知道 我很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And up she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它抬起来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And down she goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.08,0:03:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后又下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:32.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just remembering my first ever attempts at cultivating,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.36,0:03:32.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我还记得四年前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:35.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}what, four years ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:35.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我第一次尝试耕种的场景
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:39.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now look at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:39.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看我现在的技术
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.72,0:03:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在学习
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next day, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.44,0:03:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但第二天 当我回去种芥菜籽时...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.88,0:03:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}when I returned to plant the mustard seeds...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, I'm drilling mustard.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 我在播种芥菜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:57.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That is what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.68,0:03:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我正在种芥菜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I came up against my number-one irritation.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:04:02.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...我遇到了最令我恼火的问题
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:05.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.84,0:04:05.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:09.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Absolutely no way I can see my marker.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.92,0:04:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我根本看不到我的标记
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how the bloody hell am I supposed to...?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.36,0:04:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我到底该怎么...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:17.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've explained this a million times before, but this...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:17.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我之前已经解释过无数次了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:19.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}little...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.12,0:04:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我拖着的这只“小金属甲壳虫”
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.72,0:04:22.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}metal beetle that I'm dragging along here
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is 3 m to the left of the tractor,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.20,0:04:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在拖拉机左侧三米处
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:27.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so when I turn round and come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.48,0:04:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以当我掉头回来时 如果我保持其留下的标记
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.52,0:04:29.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if I keep the mark it's making
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}centred on my bonnet,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:35.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我的引擎盖中央 那就表示 我离已经种过的地方有三米远
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.08,0:04:35.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know I'm 3 m away from the bit I've already done.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:40.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Problem is, it's not leaving a mark. Not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.60,0:04:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}问题是 它没留下标记
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm just guessing where I've planted. I've absolutely no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.00,0:04:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只能猜测已经种过了哪些地方 我一头雾水
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:53.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was all very tricky and annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.00,0:04:53.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这一切都很棘手 而且烦人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:55.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But at least,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.08,0:04:58.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但至少在拖拉机里的时间让我有空
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.68,0:04:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}time in the tractor did give me head space
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:02.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to dream up new ways of farming the unfarmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.24,0:05:02.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去构思耕种未耕地的新方法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:06.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And soon, I had a brainwave,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.24,0:05:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很快 我有了灵感 很想跟查理分享一下
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.36,0:05:09.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which I was keen to share with Charlie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.20,0:05:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mushrooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.56,0:05:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.60,0:05:14.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.36,0:05:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm... why? We've got quite a lot going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.00,0:05:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么啊?我们已经够忙的了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:25.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, we have got quite a lot going on. But this is incredibly easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.64,0:05:25.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 我们已经有很多事情在忙了 但种蘑菇非常简单
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've been looking into this. I've done a business plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:28.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直在研究种蘑菇 已经做了商业计划
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've done a business plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.64,0:05:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你已经有商业计划了?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:33.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We get two hundred blocks. Er... bags. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.96,0:05:33.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你需要200块...那种袋子 好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:36.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Grow bags? - Basically, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.92,0:05:36.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 蘑菇种植袋 - 差不多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:38.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the first time they grow... In two weeks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.32,0:05:38.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们第一次生长...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we will have 1.2 kilograms of mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.72,0:05:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在两周后 我们就能收获 1.2千克的蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:45.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.36,0:05:45.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:47.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which we can sell
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:51.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果种的是灰蚝菇 每千克可以卖24英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.00,0:05:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for £24 per kilogram if they're grey oysters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:55.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And in the first flush, the profit...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.04,0:05:55.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后第一茬利润...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"In the first flush?" What's a flush? - Two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.60,0:05:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 第一茬 一茬要多久? - 两周
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:05:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Two weeks? So first growing period.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.20,0:05:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}两周?第一段生长期?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:02.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- The first growing period, two weeks. - Two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.80,0:06:02.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 第一段生长期 两周 - 两周
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£3,620.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}3620英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. That's impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 真令人印象深刻
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is impressive. - It's almost too impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.56,0:06:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 的确 - 太印象深刻了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is minusing the costs of the bags, to buy the grow bags.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.68,0:06:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这个数据已经减去了购买
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - It's got the...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 种植袋的成本 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the mushroom spores, I suppose, in already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.32,0:06:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得袋子里已经包含了蘑菇孢子
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:19.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.56,0:06:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 第二茬...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.60,0:06:21.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The second time they flush...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:23.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you get more than one harvest.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:23.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你不止采收一次?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The second time they flush, you get only
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.56,0:06:28.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二茬 每袋只能收获350克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.32,0:06:28.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}350 grams per bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So it goes down from 1.2
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.44,0:06:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以从1.2千克降至350克
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:34.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to 350 grams. But you don't have to buy the bag again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.56,0:06:34.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但不必再次购买种植袋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the profit drops from £3,620
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.44,0:06:38.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以利润从3620降至2135
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.52,0:06:38.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to £2,135.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay. Yeah. - Yes, but it's still pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.92,0:06:40.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:44.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that's £5,700 and...?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.52,0:06:42.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我明白你的意思 - 还是挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.52,0:06:44.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以能赚5700...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you get a third flush. Again, £2,100.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.40,0:06:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你能采收第三茬 获利2100英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then you're done, your bags are done.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.56,0:06:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后就结束了 种植袋就没用了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- And you replace them with 200 more. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.52,0:06:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你再购买200个新的蘑菇种植袋 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:55.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bags. Blocks. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.36,0:06:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 新土块 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So about £8,000. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.84,0:06:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 大概8000英镑 - 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So do you need power? - You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.28,0:07:00.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你需要电力吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just a tiny bit for a little heater.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.04,0:07:02.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}需要 只需要一点点 给加热器用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:04.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but you might not need very much,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.52,0:07:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 虽然可能需求量不大
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- but the cable's quite a lot of money. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.08,0:07:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但电费挺贵的 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:09.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Who's... Are you gonna pick them? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.20,0:07:08.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁来...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.32,0:07:09.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你来采摘蘑菇吗? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where are you selling them? - In the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.76,0:07:11.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你在哪里卖呢? - 在商店里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:15.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You say there's a profit of £8,000. Yes! Wooden shelving.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.84,0:07:15.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你说利润可达8000英镑 但... - 是的 需要木质货架
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna get Alan to-- - Oh, here we go. There are more costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.08,0:07:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我会让艾伦... - 开始了 成本增加了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, of course, there are costs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然有成本了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:20.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A fogger fan: £40.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.00,0:07:22.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个雾化风扇40英镑 排气扇大概100英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.76,0:07:22.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Extraction fan for hatch: £100.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:25.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Grow-room lights: £60. - Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.92,0:07:25.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 种植房的灯60英镑 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ultrasonic fogger: £160. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.80,0:07:27.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 超声波雾化器160英镑 - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:30.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Water hoover for cleaning: £95.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.72,0:07:30.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}清洁用的吸水器95英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-£455. - Which is brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:32.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 总共455英镑 - 这太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But they all run on electricity which you haven't got there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但这些器械全都要用电 而你没有算那部分费用
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I actually quite like this idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.08,0:07:38.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我其实很喜欢这个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:40.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You do? - I think it's quite good.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.68,0:07:40.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是吗? - 我觉得这挺好的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You look at my workings out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.36,0:07:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以看看我的计算...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not gonna check your workings. I'm not a maths teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.96,0:07:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我才不看你的计算呢 我又不是数学老师
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I just... - I'm just getting a bit better now
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我就... - 我现在有所长进
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:51.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- at planning the costs of things...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:51.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以在做事前计算成本了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:53.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...before I do something
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.20,0:07:55.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而不是事后计算 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- rather than working out afterwards. - Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mushroom meeting over,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.12,0:07:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇会议结束
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:00.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Charlie then insisted we register the piglet births
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:00.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后查理坚持要求 我们向政府的猪警察
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:03.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}with the government's pig police.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.88,0:08:02.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}登记猪崽的出生情况
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.56,0:08:03.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出生
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And this meant deploying
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.76,0:08:09.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着要出动 迪丽斯库阿特的整个数学团队
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:08.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the entire Diddly Squat mathematics team.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:13.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, how many piglets died in the end?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.36,0:08:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后死了几只猪崽?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:15.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Two from the first one. - Three from the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.12,0:08:15.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 第一头母猪生的死了两只 - 第一头的死了三只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:17.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Three from the first one. - No, she gave birth to ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:17.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 三只 - 不对 它生了十只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:18.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Five. - Five.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.68,0:08:18.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 五只 - 五只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:22.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Second sow, down here, had ten. Sat on two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.88,0:08:22.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二头母猪生了十只 坐死了两只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But there are only seven remaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.44,0:08:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但只剩七只了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Are you sure she hasn't got eight? I counted eight the other day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.80,0:08:27.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你确定它不是生了八只吗? - 对 我前几天数的是八只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We're never gonna get this done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.40,0:08:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们永远都算不清楚的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've now been an hour and we've registered one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.92,0:08:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经填了一个小时了 只注册了一只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.60,0:08:35.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}两只
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.48,0:08:36.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:41.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sadly, I had to leave the maths class early,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.92,0:08:41.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很遗憾 我不得不提前离开数学课堂
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}because I'd arranged to show Alan the Builder
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.36,0:08:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我安排了给建筑工人艾伦展示
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:47.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the site I'd earmarked for my mushroom operation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.04,0:08:47.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我准备用来种蘑菇的场地
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, so mushroom production.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.12,0:08:53.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 蘑菇养殖
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:55.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's this place, which you can't even see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.08,0:08:55.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这儿有个你看不到的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not brilliant, no. - This is the old pumping house
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 听着...不 - 我觉得这是
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- for the farm. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.76,0:08:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农场的旧泵房
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:01.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}150 years ago? - Victorian pumping station, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.32,0:09:01.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 是一百五十年前的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good God!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.08,0:09:03.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}维多利亚式泵房 没错 好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Easy repair job for you. - Fucking hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.88,0:09:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对你而言 修缮很简单的 - 天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Not a prayer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}痴心妄想
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the perfect mushroom-growing facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.00,0:09:10.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有完美的蘑菇生长设施
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:13.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. It's dangerous. - What do you mean "no"?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.12,0:09:12.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不行 -“不行”是什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.76,0:09:13.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:16.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's dangerous? - The lot will fall down on somebody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:16.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么很危险? - 入口上面的土会掉到人身上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.60,0:09:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go and jump on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你跳上去试试
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That old barrelled arch, look, they've put soil on the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.04,0:09:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那座老拱门 它顶部有土
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:24.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anybody puts any weight on there, that'll just collapse.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.36,0:09:24.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}任何人给它施加任何重量 它都会坍塌
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, we can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.20,0:09:25.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我们不能这么做
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:28.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you familiar with Brunel's Maidenhead Bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.28,0:09:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道布鲁奈尔的梅登黑德大桥吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:29.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.88,0:09:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:32.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, mate. Look, it's rotten. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.76,0:09:32.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 你看 它腐烂了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:34.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, you... - Yeah, but I--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:34.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 但... - 不要把东西拉出来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:37.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Don't pull things over. - But it's gonna fall over very shortly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:37.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它很快就会坍塌 然后被冲进溪流里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's gonna be in this stream. But it's...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.28,0:09:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看12世纪的那些大教堂的拱门
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at all those arches in cathedrals from the 12th century!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.28,0:09:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看我们路上到处都是这些破玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.00,0:09:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's all this shit everywhere in our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Don't get me wrong. I can do it. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.52,0:09:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 别误会我的意思 我可以修 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just gonna cost an absolute fortune.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:47.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}只是需要花很多钱
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:50.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've never heard so many negative waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.12,0:09:50.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我从没听过这么多负面意见 - 去你的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fuckin' hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.44,0:09:54.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会终生种植蘑菇 但一分钱都赚不到
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.64,0:09:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'll be growing mushrooms the rest of our lives and still make no money.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- All right. Come on then. Sorry, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:56.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好吧 那你跟我来 - 抱歉 老板
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I then took him to a backup site:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:10:00.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我带他去了备用地点
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:02.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}an underground bunker
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:02.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}农场最北边的一个地下掩体
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}at the top end of the farm on land which had once been an airfield.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.72,0:10:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}位于以前的机场区域里
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it's an air-raid shelter, personally.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.72,0:10:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我个人觉得这是一个防空洞
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was an American bomber base in the Second World War.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在二战期间 它是美国轰炸机基地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. We'll see.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.76,0:10:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们看看吧 我要跟你说的是...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:18.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What I was saying to you-- - This is going to be a mushroom facility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.72,0:10:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但现在这地方会变成蘑菇种植基地
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- But look here. - Our security needs beefing up.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.52,0:10:19.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但你看... - 问题是
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.76,0:10:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要加强其安全性
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, where is Gerald? - I'm gonna put a sign. Yes, quite.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.44,0:10:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 杰拉德在哪里? - 我会放一个...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- He's getting better. Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对了 他好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 'Cause he's having radiotherapy. Yeah, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.60,0:10:25.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.64,0:10:28.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 因为他在做放疗 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:29.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We need some light.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.20,0:10:29.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要光线
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:34.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Is that concrete? Yes, it's concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.32,0:10:34.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那是混凝土吗? - 是的 是混凝土
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:36.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, you can see the bars, look. Oh yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.24,0:10:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 你会看到那儿有栏杆 - 看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, the sceptics will have overdone it. There'll be concrete be this thick.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怀疑论者可能会过分夸大 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They will have done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.24,0:10:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 混凝土有这么厚 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:44.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, it's obviously a lot bigger than the pumping house.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.76,0:10:44.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它显然比泵房大得多
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Easy access. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.96,0:10:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}方便进出
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:48.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Don't need planning permission. No it's already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.24,0:10:48.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不需要规划许可 因为它在地下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:51.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, listen. This ain't big money, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.76,0:10:51.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不需要 它已经... 听着 这可不需要大把资金 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Dunno. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.32,0:10:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我不知道 - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:55.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No! What's not big money?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.40,0:10:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不需要? - 那是多少?毛估一下呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:56.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Rough guess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, you... He always does this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我...他总是这么对我
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.04,0:11:01.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}出去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:04.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it's one of those things that is kind of normal,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.20,0:11:04.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}询问建筑工人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to ask a builder how much something's likely to--
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.48,0:11:07.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}某个项目的估价挺正常的...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but I've only looked at it two minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我两分钟前才看到这地方...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:11.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's just say we could do it for less than ten grand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.20,0:11:11.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这么说吧 要改造这个地方 需要不到一万英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.24,0:11:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:14.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now that's a bargain! - Well, that would be good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.16,0:11:14.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这价格很便宜 - 那就太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:17.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Honestly, we'd turn this round in a week, wouldn't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.60,0:11:17.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 我们一周就能交付
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:21.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I've never heard builders... We'll have you up and running.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.36,0:11:21.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我从没听过建筑工人说... - 对 我们会让你迅速启动
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"I can do it in a week and for less than ten grand."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.24,0:11:23.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我可以一周内完工 只需不到一万”从没人听过这话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Nobody's ever heard this. - Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.92,0:11:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等我开工的时候 你就可以在店里宣传了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.64,0:11:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}By the time I've started work, you'll be able to advertise them down the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:29.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's how quick I'll be.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:29.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我就是这么快
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As Alan went off to get supplies,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.96,0:11:34.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾伦去拿材料时
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I started work on another brainwave I'd had.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.92,0:11:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开始着手落实我的另一个想法
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Nettles.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.12,0:11:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}荨麻
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The woods were literally carpeted with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.28,0:11:44.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}树林里真的铺满了这种植物
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:50.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And I'd decided they could be used to make soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.16,0:11:50.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得可以用它们来做汤
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right, Lucca? - How's it going?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.16,0:11:54.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好了 卢卡 - 还好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:57.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lucca is Diddly Squat's Swiss Army knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.40,0:11:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卢卡是迪丽斯库阿特的瑞士军刀
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:11:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He's a racing driver,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.76,0:12:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他是一个赛车手 在农场商店工作
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.68,0:12:01.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}he works at the farm shop,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:06.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and he comes from a famous Irish cooking dynasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.00,0:12:06.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且他来自一个 著名的爱尔兰烹饪王朝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:09.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right, so, nettle soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.76,0:12:09.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 所以荨麻汤 卢卡其实给我做过 大概...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:12.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lucca actually made some for me about... When was it? Last year?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.52,0:12:12.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是什么时候来着?去年? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. - About the nicest thing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.44,0:12:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是我吃过最好吃的东西了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:16.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've ever put in my mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It was stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.76,0:12:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常惊艳
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:22.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All the ingredients we need are here. Potatoes, onions, we've got here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:22.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要的所有食材都在这里 土豆、洋葱 我们这里都有
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What else do you need?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.60,0:12:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你还需要什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:27.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we've got nettles. We've got onions. We've got spuds.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.40,0:12:27.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们有荨麻、洋葱和土豆
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:29.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Salt, pepper,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.92,0:12:31.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}盐、胡椒、鸡肉高汤、奶油和黄油
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.16,0:12:31.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}chicken stock, cream and butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And that's it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.52,0:12:33.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就这些吗? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Once Lucca had finished cooking,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.24,0:12:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卢卡做好以后
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:42.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I just needed someone with a sophisticated palate
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.24,0:12:43.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只需要找个老饕尝一尝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.24,0:12:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to taste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've never had nettle soup? I've never had nettle soup.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你从没喝过荨麻汤吗? - 从没喝过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, look at the colour of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.80,0:12:52.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这汤的颜色 让人难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.92,0:12:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The colour is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a good, thick soup as well,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这种汤既好喝又浓稠
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so with some of our sourdough, it'll go great.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.48,0:12:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}搭配一点我们的酸面包会非常好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Christ. That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.28,0:12:58.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 真好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow! - It's properly good, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.84,0:13:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这...真的很好喝 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mate! You can cook!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:03.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}朋友 你可真会做饭
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.16,0:13:05.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:08.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the funny thing is, nobody knows what a nettle tastes like.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.36,0:13:08.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有趣的是 没人知道荨麻的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What does it taste like? - But you know it's a nettle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它是什么味的? - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.64,0:13:12.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但你知道这是荨麻
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:15.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In the aftertaste you should get a bit of a nettle kind of taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.52,0:13:15.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}回味的时候 你应该 能感受到一点荨麻的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.32,0:13:16.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.32,0:13:16.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好喝
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.40,0:13:17.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:19.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You'd sell this at the shop. I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.76,0:13:19.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你要在商店里卖这汤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:23.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the only thing that worries me about our board now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.32,0:13:23.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在唯一需要担心的 是我这边的利润情况
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If you make a lot of that...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.28,0:13:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你卖很多汤的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:28.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got to get that in the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.20,0:13:28.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得在商店里卖汤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:32.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That is going to be our next big thing. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.96,0:13:32.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它会成为我们的下一个热门产品 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm gonna spray them all off so you can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.36,0:13:34.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会把它们都弄洒 让你没法卖
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:36.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.16,0:13:36.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不会的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With the tasting completed,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.28,0:13:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}品尝会结束后 我借了一些重要的收割武器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.08,0:13:43.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I borrowed some serious harvesting fire power
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and headed off into the woods.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.92,0:13:46.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后前往树林
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:51.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I found this,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我发现了这个 这是用来采茶的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is used for harvesting tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:14:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's basically like a hedge clipper, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.72,0:14:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它就像是树篱剪刀 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:07.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a fan that blows the leaves into the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.72,0:14:07.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是一个风扇 能把叶片吹进袋子里
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.88,0:14:10.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后如果有异形过来
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.08,0:14:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if an alien comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can do a Sigourney Weaver on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.28,0:14:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以像西格妮韦弗这么移动
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Harvesting!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.08,0:14:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}收割
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:31.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What I've done is I've harvested my own collection sack.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.80,0:14:31.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我刚刚收获了自己的收集袋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:34.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's plainly not supposed to have happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.68,0:14:34.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这显然不该发生
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.84,0:14:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God. It hit me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.00,0:14:39.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 它打到我的脸了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.72,0:14:42.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. I'm attached to a tree and my bag's stuck in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.76,0:14:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 我跟树缠到了一起 我的包卡在...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:52.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh! Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.20,0:14:52.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.40,0:14:56.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:14:58.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bloody hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.48,0:14:58.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}见鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.32,0:15:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}For fuck's sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.32,0:15:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:11.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I stuck at it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.48,0:15:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我一直收割 直到我衰老的身体 再也无法承受
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.80,0:15:14.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}until my ageing body could take no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:17.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.72,0:15:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的后背哟
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:23.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then, I headed back to the farm with my loot...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.60,0:15:23.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我带着战利品回到农场...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lovely. Hundreds and hundreds of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.96,0:15:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不错 成千上百的荨麻叶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...where, it turned out, there was a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.12,0:15:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...结果有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lucca had said he only wanted young, sweet nettles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.12,0:15:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卢卡说过他只想要嫩叶
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:40.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But my machine hadn't got the memo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.88,0:15:40.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我的机器可不知道这事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:46.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think it's harvested grass, blackberries, trees,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.24,0:15:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得它还收割了 草、黑莓、树木和建筑物
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.24,0:15:47.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}buildings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The best way to get nettles picked, if you want nettles picked,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.60,0:15:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果你想采摘荨麻 最好的方法就是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is a few young lads there from the farm shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.12,0:15:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让农场商店里的年轻小伙子去摘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.84,0:15:56.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you think the kids in the shop will go and pick nettles?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.84,0:15:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你觉得店里的孩子会去采摘荨麻吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.28,0:15:58.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然会去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Pay them £8.50 an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.72,0:16:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 时薪给他们8.5英镑就行 - 但那会增加我的成本
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:02.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But that brings me onto the costings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.12,0:16:04.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以要制作两百罐
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.28,0:16:04.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So to make 200 jars,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- we've got to spend £38 on butter. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}买黄油要38英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:10.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-£77 on cream. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.44,0:16:08.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.36,0:16:10.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 奶油77英镑 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:13.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The nettles are free. Well, they...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.88,0:16:13.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}荨麻免费 它们...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:17.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But not if I have to start paying someone to go and pick them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.84,0:16:17.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但如果我得雇人去采摘 那就不是免费的了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Potatoes, they're £6.40.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.96,0:16:20.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土豆 6.4英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:24.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stock, which we bought from the supermarket: £67.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.44,0:16:24.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们从超市买来的高汤67英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the containers are £120.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.04,0:16:28.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}容器120英镑 标签50英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:28.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Labels will be £50.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Now, I reckon we can sell them for a fiver each.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.76,0:16:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在我觉得我们可以 以每罐五英镑的价格出售
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.20,0:16:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 轻松容易 - 你觉得呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:34.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You reckon? - Oh yeah. Big time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.16,0:16:34.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以 能大卖
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Sadly, before we had a chance to finish the calculations,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很不幸 在我们有机会完成计算前
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:41.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mister Rules and Regulations arrived...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.64,0:16:41.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}规章制度先生来了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.00,0:16:42.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...to make his usual tiresome contribution.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.00,0:16:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他像往常一样做出烦人的贡献
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Has he got his Environmental Health?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他有环境卫生证吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Lucca? Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.12,0:16:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 卢卡? - 怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:52.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you got your Environmental Health...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.56,0:16:52.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你有环境卫生吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Certificate. - Certificate?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.40,0:16:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 证书 - 证书?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.08,0:16:55.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:56.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That sounded like...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.48,0:16:59.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 那听起来似乎是没有 - 就像丽莎口中的“对对”
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.64,0:16:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's almost like Lisa said, "Yes, yes."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:04.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do they teach you in Ireland how to say, "Yeah, yeah" when you mean "no"?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.32,0:17:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}爱尔兰人会教你 如何在答案为否定的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.80,0:17:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 说“有有”吗? - 有有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:07.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm convinced in Ireland there's actual lessons
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.52,0:17:07.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我相信在爱尔兰真有那种课程教你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:10.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where you go, "When someone asks you a question and the answer is 'no',
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当有人问你问题 而答案是否定的 你得说对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:13.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- say 'yes' but say it like this." Twice!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.64,0:17:14.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但要说“有有” - 要说两次
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.04,0:17:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"Yeah, yeah." "Yeah, yeah."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:15.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"Yeah, yeah." -"Yeah, yeah."
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.28,0:17:16.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 有有 你到底有没有? - 有有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.28,0:17:16.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have you actually got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:18.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, yeah, no. In fact...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.92,0:17:18.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好吧 没有 但回到... - 果然没有 好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:21.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Yeah, no!" Okay! There's a variation on a theme!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.80,0:17:21.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这下主题可就不一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What goes in your nettle soup?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你的荨麻汤里放了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Butter, cream... Yeah. What we're--
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.80,0:17:25.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}黄油?奶油?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.40,0:17:26.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们在练习... - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, so, you'll need to put a "best before" label on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.80,0:17:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你们得贴上“赏味期限”的标签
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.96,0:17:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:32.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You haven't thought about that? - Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:32.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们没想到这一点 对吧? - 对对
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.16,0:17:35.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没想到 对对 我在学习呢
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:34.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.80,0:17:35.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm learning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Leaving Lucca to get on with the soup operation,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.64,0:17:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我让卢卡继续煮汤
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:45.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I went off to the wild-farmed wheat and bean field
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.08,0:17:45.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我去了野生小麦和豆子混种田 跟安迪卡托一起
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to do chemistry with Andy Cato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.04,0:17:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}做化学实验
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:50.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is a Brix test,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.44,0:17:50.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是白利糖度测试
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:54.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which is gonna measure the amount of sugar
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.76,0:17:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它将测量我们测试的植物中的含糖量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.32,0:17:56.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in whatever plant we test.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:59.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what we're gonna do is gather some leaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.16,0:17:59.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们要收集一些叶片
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:02.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}put them in the garlic crusher,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.56,0:18:02.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}将它们放进大蒜压榨器
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}squeeze a bit of liquid onto that lens and see what it says.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.00,0:18:05.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}往透镜上挤一点液体 看检测结果如何
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You wanna give it a whirl?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.32,0:18:07.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你想试试吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:10.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When I thought I'd be a farmer I never thought:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.48,0:18:10.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当我想到成为一个农民时 我从没想到
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, I need a garlic crusher, for sure, and a microscope."
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.28,0:18:13.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我肯定需要 一个大蒜压榨器和一台显微镜”
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Grab some leaves. You need more than you think.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.32,0:18:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拿些叶片 需要的量比你想象的大
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:19.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.92,0:18:19.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.32,0:18:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:25.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Back at school now. - Every day's a school day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.96,0:18:25.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 像回到学校课堂了一样 对吧? - 每天都是上学日
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:27.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So have a look through there, towards the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.68,0:18:27.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后朝向太阳看里面
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you should see a blue bit and a white bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.44,0:18:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你应该能看到蓝色和白色的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.92,0:18:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}白利糖度% 麦芽汁比重
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just above five. I'm gonna say six?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:36.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 比五多一点 算六吗? - 六?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:36.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Six.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:41.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That level of Brix means that the plants haven't got all the nutrients they need.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.28,0:18:39.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 这个白利糖度水平
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.20,0:18:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说明植物缺乏必要的养分
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we'll do a sap test, which is kind of like a blood test for a plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.08,0:18:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们要做一次树汁测试 就像植物的血液测试一样
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the point is obviously not to just go for the pretty ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们显然不应该 重点关注那种长得好的叶片
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just walk in a straight line and take what's in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.24,0:18:51.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就往前直走 拿你面前的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:52.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've got you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:52.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:55.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.76,0:18:55.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Perfect. I'll get these off to the lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.68,0:18:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}完美 我会把这些叶片拿去实验室
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When the tests came back,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.56,0:19:02.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}测试结果送回来时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:05.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was away filming again for The Grand Tour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:05.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我又去拍摄《大世界之旅》了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, Charlie and Kaleb had to discuss the results with Andy.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.80,0:19:10.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以查理和卡莱布 不得不跟安迪讨论检测结果
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:13.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Test results show...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.96,0:19:13.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}检测结果表明...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.48,0:19:15.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Reveal.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.48,0:19:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}揭秘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Erm...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Blue's good. Green's good. Red is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.40,0:19:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蓝色和绿色是好结果 红色是不好的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Magnesium. Magnesium.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.96,0:19:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 镁 - 镁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, to get the crops sort of,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.32,0:19:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以 要让作物...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- you know, balanced out... Balanced out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 营养均衡 - ...营养均衡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:31.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We need to put some magnesium on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.76,0:19:31.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们需要加一点镁
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:35.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Luckily, we can put that on in a very simple form.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.68,0:19:35.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}幸运的是 我们可以 以很简单的方式加进去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Epsom salts.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.00,0:19:38.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 泻盐 - 盐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:41.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bath salts. - Bath salts. Literally.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.48,0:19:41.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 沐浴盐 - 就用沐浴盐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I thought we wasn't putting anything on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.52,0:19:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我以为 我们不会给这块地加任何东西
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:45.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I thought we was just gonna leave it. No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.08,0:19:45.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 放任不管就行 - 不行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We can't just leave it because we can't just sort of hope
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.96,0:19:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们不能放任不管 因为我们不能指望
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:50.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that the soil is at a point
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.80,0:19:50.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}到了某个时候
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:52.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}where it can provide the crop with everything that it needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.08,0:19:52.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}土壤能提供作物所需的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And when things are lacking, we use a natural nutritional product,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.24,0:19:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}缺少营养元素时
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:57.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}like bath salts in this case,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.56,0:19:57.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们会使用天然营养产品 比如现在要用的沐浴盐
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to put it right. - I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 来补充营养 - 我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:03.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not sure he did see,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.24,0:20:03.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从他对使用沐浴盐
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}judging by the amount of moaning he did while applying the bath salts.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.48,0:20:09.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}抱怨的数量来看 我不确定他是否真的明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:12.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My wheat looks better.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.32,0:20:12.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的小麦看起来好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why is it so patchy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为什么这么不均匀?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:16.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really green and then like...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.72,0:20:16.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些绿油油的 然后...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:18.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And really thin there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:18.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里有点薄
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:22.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Moaning which carried on even after he'd finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.56,0:20:22.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}即使是结束后 他也还在抱怨
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:24.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.76,0:20:24.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.48,0:20:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, he comes over, tells me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.48,0:20:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他过来跟我说 一个农民要做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:30.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as a farmer, what to do, you, what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.40,0:20:30.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你该做什么 我没去他家里说
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:34.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't go to his house and say he needs a guitar in a certain song.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.96,0:20:34.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他在唱某首歌的时候需要吉他
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:35.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not sure he's telling us what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.40,0:20:35.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他不是告诉我们该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:39.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think he's giving us the background of his ideas
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.80,0:20:39.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得他是在告诉我们 他的想法的背景
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.24,0:20:41.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and how they want to grow stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.24,0:20:42.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 以及他们想怎么种 - 这让我很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:42.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It annoys me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is that because it's a different way of doing things?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.20,0:20:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是因为做事方式不一样吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:47.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As a farmer, I don't like change. I think every farmer don't like change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.52,0:20:46.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}作为农民 我不喜欢改变
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.08,0:20:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得每个农民都不喜欢改变
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:50.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I hate this field now.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.44,0:20:50.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我现在讨厌这块地
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:55.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When I came back from my filming trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.96,0:20:55.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当我结束拍摄旅行回来时
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:59.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided we should get on with the dam repairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.48,0:20:59.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定继续修缮堤坝
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And, to stop the arguing this usually caused,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.32,0:21:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了平息修缮堤坝引起的争论
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:05.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb and I said we should "transition."
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.64,0:21:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卡莱布和我说我们应该过渡一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:08.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Remember, when you put this on... - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.76,0:21:08.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 现在记住 当你穿上这背心时... - 怎么?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We are construction workers.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.76,0:21:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- ...我们是建筑工人 没错 - 对 不是农民
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Right. Not farmers. - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So I'm now perfectly safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.56,0:21:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我现在很安全
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like a cup of tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.16,0:21:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}想喝杯茶吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Tea break? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.68,0:21:16.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}茶歇?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:18.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ten o'clock. Tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.92,0:21:18.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 十点了 喝茶
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:20.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.88,0:21:20.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.20,0:21:21.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right. Tea break. Then what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.20,0:21:21.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好嘞 茶歇 然后呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:23.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We roll a fag.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.88,0:21:23.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卷支烟抽一下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Then another tea break when we smoke the cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.56,0:21:26.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后我们抽烟时再来一个茶歇?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no, no. No. Don't smoke the cigarette on your tea break.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.04,0:21:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 不能在茶歇时抽烟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:31.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You have your tea and then smoke it when you start work again.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.96,0:21:31.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}喝茶 然后重新开始工作的时候抽烟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So anyone in construction's going to be very angry with us for saying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}建筑工地的所有工人 都会因为我们说的这些话生气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:36.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't think so. I think they understand. I think they know.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.88,0:21:36.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得他们理解
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They know exactly what they're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得他们知道自己在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:45.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Job one was to drop some clay off at the side of the dam.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.92,0:21:45.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一项工作是 往堤坝的这边倒一些黏土
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:47.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God strewth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:47.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.72,0:21:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.12,0:21:56.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:21:58.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.28,0:21:58.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:01.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A little bit of clay went in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一点黏土进去了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.00,0:22:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一点?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:07.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We'd better discuss that. Over a cup of tea!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:05.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们最好讨论一下...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:07.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}边喝茶边讨论
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who've we got tomorrow? Is it West Brom? No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}明天要跟哪支队比赛? 是西布朗吗?不是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:24.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Who, Chelsea?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:25.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是切尔西吗? - 不是 布伦特福德
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.84,0:22:26.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. Brentford.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna lose that. - Oh I know we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:27.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你输定了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:29.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we could be relegated.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.40,0:22:29.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 我觉得我们可能会降级
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think we're gonna meet Wrexham coming the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.96,0:22:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们会遇到 另一边来的雷克瑟姆队
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:35.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You may as well join them. Get in for the fame. Ryan Reynolds.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.68,0:22:35.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你得加入他们 争取像瑞安雷诺兹一样出名
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:37.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking hell, we've got Chadlington now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.52,0:22:37.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们现在有查德灵顿了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:40.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was with him in the pub, actually, on Saturday night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.44,0:22:40.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}实际上 我周六晚上 跟他一起在酒吧喝酒
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:42.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They'd just won. They won on Saturday.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.44,0:22:42.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们周六赢了 - 有个人找到我说
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:45.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This guy come up to me and he was like, "I could beat you in arm wrestle."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.32,0:22:45.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“我觉得你掰手腕赢不了我”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:46.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh, I saw that. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.20,0:22:46.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 显而易见 - 真的吗?他说:“对 我能赢你”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:48.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"I could beat you in arm wrestle-" - But you beat him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:48.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但你赢了他 - 我说:“如果我赢了你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:51.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I said, "All right, if I beat you, you buy me a pint.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.52,0:22:51.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“你就请我喝一杯 如果你赢了我 我就给你买一杯”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.40,0:22:53.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If I beat you I'll buy you a pint."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.40,0:22:53.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 他说:“好的”
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:22:58.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I know someone who married
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.48,0:23:00.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道有个人娶了他继母的妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.68,0:23:00.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}his step-mother's sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.92,0:23:04.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which made it... I think it made him his own uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.92,0:23:04.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以...我觉得他成了自己的叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:07.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, he became his own uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.04,0:23:07.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 他成了自己的叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.56,0:23:17.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Finished? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.56,0:23:17.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 喝完了? - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:19.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's roll a fag.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.92,0:23:19.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们来卷根烟
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:25.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next job was to set up the laser to get the right levels,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.64,0:23:25.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一项工作是放置激光器 确保水平位置正确
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then remove the pipe...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:28.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后移除管道... - 不
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.24,0:23:28.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:30.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...so we could pack in the clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.68,0:23:30.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...这样我们就能填土了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:32.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.88,0:23:32.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.40,0:23:35.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But before we could do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.40,0:23:35.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但在这一步之前
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:38.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we had to reduce the water level in the pond.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:38.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们必须降低池塘里的水位
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.20,0:23:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The problem we've got...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.20,0:23:42.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们遇到的问题是那是溢流管
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.64,0:23:42.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the overflow pipe,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:44.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which you can just see there,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.08,0:23:44.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以看到它显然被堵住了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:47.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and it's obviously blocked because there's hardly anything coming out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.00,0:23:48.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为下面的另一端几乎没有水流出来
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.20,0:23:48.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}at the other end down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.76,0:23:51.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If we can get that clear with some rods,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.76,0:23:51.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们能用棍子将其清理干净
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:53.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that will take a lot of the water,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.88,0:23:53.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那能带走很多水
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:58.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which will reduce the amount of water going through the dam site.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:58.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}从而减少通过堤坝的水量
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This meant Kaleb had to get into another gimp suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.40,0:24:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这意味着卡莱布 必须穿上另一套紧身衣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:06.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's deep. - It's just silty. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.44,0:24:06.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好深啊
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.52,0:24:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's deep. - It's only seven feet of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.52,0:24:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 只是淤泥而已 没事 - 很深
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.56,0:24:10.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}水深才两米
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:14.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I never thought I'd be doing sewage work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.32,0:24:14.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我从没想过我会做污水处理工作
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.24,0:24:20.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think that-- There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.24,0:24:21.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好了 水流快些了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:21.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it running faster?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.36,0:24:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. That's hardly made a difference.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.36,0:24:27.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没有 没什么区别 里面还是堵着的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.52,0:24:27.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's still got a blockage in there, mate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.20,0:24:31.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We tried unblocking it from the other end.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.20,0:24:31.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们试着从另一端清理
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But that didn't work either.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.20,0:24:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但结果也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.68,0:24:40.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.68,0:24:40.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.40,0:24:44.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, there was only one thing we could do.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.40,0:24:44.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们只能做一件事
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.96,0:24:54.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What if we squirted a fire extinguisher down it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.96,0:24:54.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们用灭火器朝管道里喷呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That wouldn't work, would it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.28,0:24:56.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那行不通吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.56,0:24:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It would massively increase the pressure, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.56,0:24:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那样能大幅度增加压力 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:25:01.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, but I don't think it would... A fire extinguisher?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.16,0:25:01.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用灭火器行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hey! You remember that pump I bought for irrigating...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.00,0:25:05.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你记得我买来灌溉用的水泵吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:06.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The trout lake!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.60,0:25:06.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鳟鱼湖里的那个?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.60,0:25:07.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, the trout lake.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.60,0:25:07.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是的 鳟鱼湖里那个
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.96,0:25:11.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You remember I bought that pump which was useless?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.96,0:25:11.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}记得吗?我买了那个水泵 根本没用
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.12,0:25:12.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, it was too powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.12,0:25:12.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它抽力太强 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.20,0:25:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. If we squirted that down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.20,0:25:15.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果我们把那水泵放到下面 那样就能把所有脏东西都喷出去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.56,0:25:15.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that would blow anything out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.28,0:25:17.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.28,0:25:17.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可以
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.80,0:25:22.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}See, if you just take a moment over a cup of tea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.80,0:25:22.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 如果你在喝茶时花点时间...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.52,0:25:24.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've had about 18 today.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.52,0:25:24.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们今天大概喝了18杯吧
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.60,0:25:27.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.88,0:25:37.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get it in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.88,0:25:37.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把它放进去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.04,0:25:39.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Fucking hell! Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.04,0:25:39.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他妈的 - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:45.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.04,0:25:45.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}该死
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.64,0:25:47.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Take that end off, let the air go out that end,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.64,0:25:47.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把那端取下来 让空气从那边出去
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.88,0:25:49.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}then I might be able to take it back out again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.88,0:25:49.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这样我就能把它取出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.28,0:25:51.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Why don't I just do the little...? The little nut at the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.28,0:25:51.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不如我来... - 顶部有一个小螺母
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:55.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Oh! Fucking hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.76,0:25:55.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.84,0:25:57.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.84,0:25:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们再试试
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:01.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.12,0:26:01.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:11.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.00,0:26:11.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我做不到
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:16.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, there's nothing I can think we can do.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.40,0:26:16.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我们无能为力了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:18.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.12,0:26:18.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.08,0:26:22.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. So what we've achieved today is...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.08,0:26:22.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 所以我们今天的成就是...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.24,0:26:24.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.24,0:26:24.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}毫无成就
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.32,0:26:29.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Get me out of these things.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.32,0:26:29.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}帮我把这衣服脱了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:31.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. Wait. We've gone backwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.92,0:26:31.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 等等 我们搞错方向了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.96,0:26:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've taken the big black pipe out of the trench
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.96,0:26:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们已经把大黑管子从沟里取了出来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.20,0:26:38.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and then left it there.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.20,0:26:38.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后就放在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.80,0:26:41.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.80,0:26:41.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在几点了?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Five? Five-thirty?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.76,0:26:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}五点 五点半
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.12,0:26:45.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Christ. Construction and we're still working?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.12,0:26:45.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 这可是建筑工作 可我们都这个点儿了却还在干
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a good point.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.88,0:26:49.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 说得好 - 我们本来该三小时前就完成的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.12,0:26:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We should have been finished three hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.16,0:26:50.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.16,0:26:50.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.44,0:26:55.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The next day,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.44,0:26:57.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天 卡莱布和我又成了农民
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.52,0:26:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb and I became farmers again
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.76,0:27:00.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and went for a crop walk
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.76,0:27:02.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}走进了大麦田进行作物巡视
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.36,0:27:02.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}in one of the barley fields.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.60,0:27:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All this...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.60,0:27:04.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有这些...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.76,0:27:07.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah? - Will be lager.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.76,0:27:07.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 嗯 - ...都会拿去酿拉格啤酒
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.36,0:27:09.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Looks good this year, dunnit?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.36,0:27:09.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今年看起来还不错 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.08,0:27:11.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many acres have we put in there of spring barley?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.08,0:27:11.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今年种了多少春大麦?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Here? You'll probably get about 300 tonnes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这里可能大概有300吨
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:15.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So 300 tonnes of spring barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.96,0:27:15.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}300吨春大麦
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:17.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much does that make in terms of pints?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.72,0:27:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那能酿多少啤酒?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.32,0:27:19.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's lots.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.32,0:27:19.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}非常多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.16,0:27:20.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where's that come from? I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.16,0:27:20.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是从哪儿来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.72,0:27:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But it doesn't wanna be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.72,0:27:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 但不能把它留在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.60,0:27:25.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wanna carry that one out?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.60,0:27:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 - 想把那块拿走吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.28,0:27:27.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}If it hits the combine header...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.28,0:27:28.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 如果它击中了联合收割机刀头... - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.68,0:27:28.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.68,0:27:32.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Our pet stones. Our pet rocks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.68,0:27:33.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们的宠物石头 我的叫罗纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.20,0:27:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mine's called Ronald.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.40,0:27:34.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mine's called Donald.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.40,0:27:34.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的叫唐纳德
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.40,0:27:36.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.40,0:27:36.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.08,0:27:39.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Ahem. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.08,0:27:39.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well you've missed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.20,0:27:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你又漏种了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.16,0:27:45.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a little bit thinner, admittedly, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.16,0:27:45.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}无可否认 确实稀少了一点 但...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.24,0:27:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I thought after last year with "Kaleb's Crack"...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.24,0:27:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我以为经过去年的 “卡莱布大裂缝”后
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:49.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.00,0:27:49.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}拜托!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.24,0:27:51.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's about 60 pints
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.24,0:27:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那损失了60品脱的豪客斯通
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.64,0:27:53.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of Hawkstone lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.84,0:27:56.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're no one to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.84,0:27:56.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可没资格说这话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.12,0:27:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - You can't say this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.12,0:27:58.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 你不能这么跟我说
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.12,0:28:01.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Really? Why? - Have you seen Louse?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.12,0:28:01.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你认真的?为什么? - 你去看过卢斯吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.40,0:28:03.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Not recently. I think we should go up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.40,0:28:03.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 最近没去 - 我觉得我们应该去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.12,0:28:07.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}All right. You are free, stone.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.12,0:28:07.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 石头 你自由了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.12,0:28:11.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb then took me to Louse,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.12,0:28:13.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后卡莱布带我去了卢斯 也就是我种植芥菜的那块田
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.00,0:28:13.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the field where I'd planted my mustard...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.44,0:28:15.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and let rip.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.44,0:28:15.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}放开手脚
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.68,0:28:18.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, look, you started drilling here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.68,0:28:18.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你看 你开始在这里种植 - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.36,0:28:20.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's where we started, yeah? Lovely lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.36,0:28:20.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是开始的地方 对吧? 多漂亮的线条啊
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.48,0:28:23.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can see the mustard coming up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.48,0:28:21.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.40,0:28:23.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以看到芥菜正在生长
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.48,0:28:25.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. - And then you come along.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.48,0:28:25.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 然后 你跟我来
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.88,0:28:28.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Fucking great miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.88,0:28:30.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}漏了好大一块地 但别担心 继续跟我走
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.84,0:28:30.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But don't worry about it. Just keep coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Beautiful lines there, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.88,0:28:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那儿的线条很漂亮 你看
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:35.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, look, another miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.64,0:28:35.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你看 又漏了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.04,0:28:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then: "Oh, fucking hell, I may as well just miss this bit as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.04,0:28:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 哎呀 你可能也漏种了这一块
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.08,0:28:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's the point of drilling that?"
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.08,0:28:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}种那一条有什么意义?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.80,0:28:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's those bloody arms that come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.80,0:28:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都怪那些伸出来的标记臂
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}An earwig would leave a more noticeable trace if it walked across the field.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.08,0:28:46.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说实话 一只蠼螋走过田地
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.32,0:28:47.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都会留下更明显的痕迹
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.96,0:28:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I knew when I was doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.96,0:28:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我种的时候就知道会是这种结果
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.04,0:28:52.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But I thought I was going over everything twice
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.04,0:28:52.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但我以为我整块地都种了两次
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}rather than missing bits.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.20,0:28:54.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不会有遗漏的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.72,0:28:58.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you fucked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.72,0:28:58.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你搞砸了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:05.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Happily, my soup enterprise
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.32,0:29:06.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}令人欣喜的是我的汤生意更成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.08,0:29:06.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}was proving to be more successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.52,0:29:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lucca had rounded up some youths to pick the nettles,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.52,0:29:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}卢卡召集了几个年轻人去采摘荨麻
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.32,0:29:14.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}cooked up a big batch,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.32,0:29:14.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}做了一大堆
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.48,0:29:18.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and dealt with Charlie's best before date issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.48,0:29:18.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还解决了查理提出的 “赏味期限”的日期问题
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.92,0:29:23.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But then, when I sat down to finally work out the pricing,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.92,0:29:23.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但然后 当我坐下来最终确定价格时
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:25.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}everything went a bit wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.28,0:29:25.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一切都有点不对劲了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.48,0:29:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}4、8、9、1、4、6、1...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.40,0:29:36.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God. This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.40,0:29:36.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 这...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.76,0:29:41.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.76,0:29:41.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:43.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I headed up to the shop
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.24,0:29:43.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我前往商店
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.68,0:29:47.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}knowing that I had to go on a charm offensive with Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.68,0:29:47.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}知道我得对丽莎展开魅力攻势
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.32,0:29:52.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello! - Look what I have brought!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.32,0:29:52.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你好 - 看看我拿来了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.00,0:29:54.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Woodland Juice! - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.00,0:29:53.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}森林果汁
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.24,0:29:54.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.16,0:29:57.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Chilled nettle soup. - Oh wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.16,0:29:57.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}冰镇荨麻汤
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.04,0:29:59.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Woodland Juice. I love the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.04,0:29:59.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}森林果汁 我喜欢这名字
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.68,0:30:02.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, Woodland Juice. Chilled and delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.68,0:30:02.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 森林果汁 冰凉美味
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.08,0:30:03.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:06.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. The only slight problem with that
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.00,0:30:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}森林果汁
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.84,0:30:06.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 只是有一个小问题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.64,0:30:10.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}is that you have got to convince the customers
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.64,0:30:09.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就是你得说服顾客...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.72,0:30:10.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.64,0:30:13.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to put nettles in their mouths
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.64,0:30:13.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- ...喝荨麻汤 - 嗯?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.36,0:30:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and pay
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.36,0:30:17.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后他们还得付10英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.16,0:30:17.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£10 for the privilege of doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.32,0:30:18.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why £10?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.32,0:30:19.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 为什么要10英镑? - 10英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.60,0:30:19.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£10.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.52,0:30:20.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.52,0:30:21.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 为什么? - 我计算过了...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.64,0:30:22.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've done the maths.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:23.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Wouldn't you do the maths before you make--
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.32,0:30:23.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你就不能在煮汤前计算吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.96,0:30:25.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I did do the maths before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.96,0:30:28.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在煮汤前计算过 但为了采摘荨麻
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.64,0:30:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, to harvest them,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.04,0:30:30.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- we had to get kids. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.04,0:30:30.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们不得不雇佣孩子们 - 是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.48,0:30:32.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They worked for eight hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.48,0:30:32.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他们工作了八个小时 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.80,0:30:36.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}picking the nettles, pulling the top leaves off and then washing them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.80,0:30:35.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}采摘荨麻 择出顶端叶片
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.04,0:30:36.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后加以清洗
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.40,0:30:39.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they only produced enough for 80 pots.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.40,0:30:39.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}可得到的叶片只够生产80罐
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.12,0:30:41.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So you thought kids worked for free?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.12,0:30:41.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以你本来以为孩子们会义务劳动?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.12,0:30:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I didn't think I was gonna have to use kids. I thought I was going
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.12,0:30:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没想到我得让孩子们来摘
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.92,0:30:45.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to be able to do it using the machine, but that doesn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.92,0:30:45.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我本来以为我能用机器采摘
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.44,0:30:48.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have to take a loss on that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.44,0:30:48.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但结果不行 - 你必须自己赔钱了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.40,0:30:50.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm not taking a loss!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.40,0:30:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我才不要自己赔钱呢!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.20,0:30:52.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, then they won't sell at all. So work it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.20,0:30:52.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这汤根本卖不出去 你想想办法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.68,0:30:54.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's another problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.68,0:30:54.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.28,0:30:56.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can see the date. - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.28,0:30:56.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以看到日期
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.80,0:30:59.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got a three-day shelf life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.80,0:30:59.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 你有三天的保质期
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.48,0:31:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the production day counts as day one, which was yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.48,0:31:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}生产日算第一天 也就是昨天
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.08,0:31:04.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So today's day two.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.08,0:31:04.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以今天是第二天
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And they must be sold by the end of play tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.36,0:31:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们必须在明天结束前卖出
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.92,0:31:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you know we're closed today.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.92,0:31:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道我们今天不营业吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.64,0:31:11.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - Stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.64,0:31:11.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 库存
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.16,0:31:13.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Stock count. You know I do stock on Wednesdays.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.16,0:31:13.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}盘点库存 你知道我每周三盘点库存
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.00,0:31:18.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, this is my stock take. Look. I'm doing all my stock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.00,0:31:18.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}今天是我的库存盘点日 我正在盘点我所有的库存
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.24,0:31:20.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes, I know. But I've got eighty of these to sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.24,0:31:20.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我知道 但我有... 我们有80罐汤需要卖出去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.92,0:31:22.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you'd better stand on the road then.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.92,0:31:22.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你最好站路边去推销
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.64,0:31:24.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Try selling it for £10.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.64,0:31:24.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}试着以10英镑的价格卖出去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.32,0:31:25.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No. It won't sell for £10.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.32,0:31:25.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不行 卖不了10英镑 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.96,0:31:27.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, do it for £9.99.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.96,0:31:27.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那就卖9.99英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.56,0:31:30.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can give them as an offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.56,0:31:30.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我可以以特价卖给顾客
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.12,0:31:32.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, don't. Please? Try?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.12,0:31:32.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不行 求你试试吧
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.32,0:31:40.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I drove away feeling like one of those Apprentice candidates
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.32,0:31:40.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我开车离开的时候 感觉自己像《学徒》节目中
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.80,0:31:43.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that get fired in week one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.80,0:31:43.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第一周就被开除的其中一名学徒
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:47.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the next day, when the shop reopened,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.72,0:31:47.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后第二天 商店重新开门时
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.56,0:31:51.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}the nettle soup best-before-date countdown began.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.56,0:31:51.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}荨麻汤的“赏味期限” 开始进入倒计时
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.92,0:31:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}森林果汁
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.04,0:31:55.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}上午10点
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.12,0:31:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.20,0:32:03.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}中午12点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.16,0:32:09.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下午2点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.96,0:32:13.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's nettle soup, for £9.99.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.96,0:32:13.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是荨麻汤 9.99英镑一罐
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:14.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.00,0:32:14.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你开玩笑的吧? - 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.08,0:32:17.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下午5点
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.08,0:32:20.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}At closing time, Lisa was not happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.08,0:32:20.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}关门时 丽莎并不开心
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.00,0:32:22.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}正在营业
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.00,0:32:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's ridiculous. I can't do anything with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.00,0:32:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这太荒唐了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.68,0:32:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And he doesn't plan in advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.68,0:32:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我拿这些汤没辙 他不提前计划
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.04,0:32:28.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He gives me no warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.04,0:32:28.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}毫无预警地拿给我
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.96,0:32:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}He just brings me these soups with his eejit face on them,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.96,0:32:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他就顶着他那张蠢脸 给我拿来了这些汤
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.52,0:32:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}charges a tenner, and says: "Sell them."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.52,0:32:35.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}说售价为10英镑 然后就让我去卖
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.92,0:32:37.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's not fair. It's stupid. It kind of makes the shop look stupid
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.92,0:32:37.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不公平 太蠢了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.88,0:32:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that he's selling these for a tenner in order for him...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.88,0:32:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}他让以10英镑的价格卖这汤 这也让这家店显得很蠢...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.96,0:32:48.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With my nettle soup causing
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.96,0:32:48.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}鉴于我的荨麻汤在经济和家庭方面
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.00,0:32:52.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}so much aggravation on both the economic and domestic front,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.00,0:32:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}都引起了诸多麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.84,0:32:55.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I decided to abandon it
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.84,0:32:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我决定放弃卖汤 专注于种蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.76,0:32:58.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and concentrate on the mushrooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.04,0:33:04.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Alan had brought power to the bunker,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.04,0:33:04.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}艾伦已经给地堡通电了 并已安装好了所有必要设备
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.84,0:33:08.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}installed all the necessary equipment...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.84,0:33:08.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看这个
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.28,0:33:11.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And look at this. Health and safety. Very unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.28,0:33:11.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}健康而安全 与众不同
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.00,0:33:14.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What is it? - It's to hold the roof up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.00,0:33:14.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是什么? - 它是用来支撑屋顶的 以防万一...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.84,0:33:16.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's a roll cage. - Yeah, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.84,0:33:16.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这是防翻架 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:21.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And once Walter White had finished disinfecting everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.92,0:33:21.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}等沃尔特怀特完成所有消毒工作
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.00,0:33:25.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we were ready to take delivery of the first batch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.00,0:33:25.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们就准备好接收第一批货了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.44,0:33:30.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Are you the mushroom fellows?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.44,0:33:30.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们是送蘑菇的朋友吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.36,0:33:31.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We are the mushroom men.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.36,0:33:31.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们是蘑菇人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.60,0:33:35.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God, Jeremy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.60,0:33:35.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天啊 杰里米 - 好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.88,0:33:38.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Holy cow. Holy Moses.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.88,0:33:38.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}老天爷啊
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.28,0:33:41.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've got just a couple of bags there for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.28,0:33:41.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 抱歉 各位 天啊 - 这些是你的蘑菇种植袋
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.44,0:33:44.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, how many different types of mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.44,0:33:44.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有多少种不同的蘑菇?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.56,0:33:46.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Three different types of mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.56,0:33:46.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有三种
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.20,0:33:47.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Which are? - You've got grey oysters,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.20,0:33:47.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}具体是?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.12,0:33:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}speckled chestnuts, lion's mane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.12,0:33:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有灰蚝菇、斑点栗蘑和猴头菇
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.96,0:33:52.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - It makes a good steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.96,0:33:52.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 做成素牛排很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.96,0:33:54.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With lion's mane?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.96,0:33:54.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}用猴头菇来做?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.08,0:33:57.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. Slice it-- - Cows make a good steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.08,0:33:57.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 把它切成片 做成素牛排 - 牛肉做的牛排很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.04,0:33:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So do mushrooms. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.04,0:33:58.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇做的也好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.04,0:33:59.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.12,0:34:01.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's he on about? Steak mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.12,0:34:01.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 他在说什么?蘑菇排? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.20,0:34:02.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah! Ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.20,0:34:02.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 太搞笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.64,0:34:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What's actually in these bags?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.64,0:34:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这些袋子里到底是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.44,0:34:09.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's kind of a combination of whatever we've got
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.44,0:34:10.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}算是我们当地可得的废料合集
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.00,0:34:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}that's available to us locally.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.16,0:34:12.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we go round local sawmills,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.16,0:34:12.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们在当地锯木厂附近走动
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.48,0:34:15.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}anyone that produces anything that has a waste organic matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.48,0:34:15.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}去了所有生产有机废料的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.20,0:34:16.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we will go round and collect it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.20,0:34:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们四处收集
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.84,0:34:19.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How do mushrooms know to grow in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.84,0:34:19.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇怎么知道在其中生长?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.40,0:34:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Or do they just grow in anything that's organic?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.40,0:34:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还是蘑菇在任何有机物里都能生长?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.76,0:34:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, they pretty much would grow in anything organic.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.76,0:34:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们几乎能在所有有机物中生长
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.08,0:34:26.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Like the oyster you could grow off fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.08,0:34:26.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}例如牡蛎菇 你可以用织物作为基质来种植
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.32,0:34:28.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- People grow off hats, clothes, shoes. - Hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.32,0:34:28.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人们用帽子、衣服、鞋子来钟
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.40,0:34:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.40,0:34:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 帽子? - 任何东西都行
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.56,0:34:31.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- You get very small yields. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.56,0:34:31.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你的产量会很小 - 嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.36,0:34:32.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hats? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.36,0:34:32.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 但...可以种 - 帽子?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.80,0:34:34.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Okay, well, look. Let's get them in, shall we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.80,0:34:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 好的 我们把它们拿进去吧? - 好的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.36,0:34:35.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.20,0:34:44.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's more.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.20,0:34:44.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有呢
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.84,0:34:49.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A lot more. Fucking hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.84,0:34:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有很多
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.08,0:34:49.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.56,0:34:53.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I ain't taking the piss: we ain't gonna get that lot in there, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.56,0:34:53.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我没开玩笑 我们不可能 把那么多都放进去 对吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.28,0:34:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I think I've overbought.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.28,0:34:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我觉得我买多了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.16,0:35:04.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've definitely overbought.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.16,0:35:04.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我绝对买多了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.44,0:35:07.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.44,0:35:07.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}天啊 我跟你说 收获的蘑菇数量
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:10.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're gonna have more mushrooms than Sainsbury's, I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.52,0:35:10.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}绝对比森宝利超市都多 看啊
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.32,0:35:11.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Look. Stop moaning!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.32,0:35:11.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}别抱怨了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.16,0:35:16.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As we filled the shelves,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.16,0:35:16.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们装填货架时
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.64,0:35:21.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was sucked into a truly extraordinary biology lesson.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.64,0:35:21.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我沉浸在了一堂非凡的生物课中
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.76,0:35:26.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The mushroom is just the sexual reproductive organ of mycelium.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.76,0:35:26.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇只是菌丝体的性生殖器官
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.76,0:35:28.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I don't know what that word is you keep using.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.76,0:35:28.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不认识你一直在说的那个词
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.92,0:35:30.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Mycelium.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.92,0:35:30.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“菌丝体” - 菌丝体
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.00,0:35:31.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The mycelium is the organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.00,0:35:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}菌丝体是有机体 蘑菇是性生殖器官
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.60,0:35:33.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The mushroom is the sexual reproductive organ.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.32,0:35:37.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The sexual reproductive organ of the mycelium is the mushroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.32,0:35:37.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}菌丝体的性生殖器官是蘑菇?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.80,0:35:40.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah. So a mushroom is a penis?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.80,0:35:40.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 所以蘑菇相当于是阴茎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.04,0:35:44.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A mushroom is a penis. Its whole objective in life is to fruit,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.04,0:35:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}蘑菇相当于是阴茎
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.16,0:35:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它一生的目标就是结出果实
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.52,0:35:47.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}release as many spores as possible and then die.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.52,0:35:47.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}释放尽可能多的孢子 然后死亡
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.16,0:35:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So when I see a vegan eating a mushroom,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.16,0:35:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当我看见素食主义者吃蘑菇时 我可以上前说
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.12,0:35:52.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}you can go: "You're actually eating a meaty penis"?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.12,0:35:52.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}-“你其实在吃肉肉的阴茎” -“把阴茎从你嘴里拿出来”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.88,0:35:57.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Get that penis out your mouth." Yeah! You absolutely can!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.88,0:35:57.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}当然可以了
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.00,0:35:59.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What does a mycelium look like?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.00,0:35:59.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}菌丝体长什么样?是...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.28,0:36:00.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's an organism.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.28,0:36:00.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它是一个有机体
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.64,0:36:04.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's an organism? So, like me? Like us. Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.64,0:36:03.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是一个有机体?那就像我一样 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.80,0:36:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是的 - 就像我们一样 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.36,0:36:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}In fact, we are very, very closely related to mycelium.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.36,0:36:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}事实上 我们跟菌丝体的关系 非常非常密切
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.56,0:36:12.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}More so than anything else on this planet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.56,0:36:12.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}比跟这个星球上的 任何其他事物都要密切
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.56,0:36:13.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- What? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.56,0:36:13.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 什么? - 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.36,0:36:18.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As humans we still have a layer of mycelium across our body.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.36,0:36:18.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们人类的身体上仍有一层菌丝体
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.16,0:36:21.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What-- You could grow mushrooms on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.16,0:36:21.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以在我身上种蘑菇吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.08,0:36:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We could definitely grow mushrooms on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.08,0:36:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们绝对能在你身上种
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.08,0:36:24.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We'd have to kill you first,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.08,0:36:24.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 我们得先杀了你... - 但能种?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.80,0:36:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- but we could grow mushrooms off you. - But you could?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:24.80,0:36:26.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...但我们能用你的身体种蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.76,0:36:30.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}As we sanitised the front of the bags,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.76,0:36:30.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们给种植袋的前面消毒时
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.52,0:36:33.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}my biology lesson got even weirder.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.52,0:36:33.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的生物课堂变得更诡异了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.16,0:36:37.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But mycelium is...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.16,0:36:37.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但菌丝体是...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.48,0:36:39.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Where is it on the DNA?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.48,0:36:39.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它从DNA上来说是怎样的?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.64,0:36:42.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Is it like dinosaurs or like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.64,0:36:42.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它像恐龙 还是像我们?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.28,0:36:43.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}There's different theories for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.28,0:36:43.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有不同的理论
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.88,0:36:46.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}One of the leading ones is it actually comes from space.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.88,0:36:46.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}其中一个主流观点是它来自太空
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.88,0:36:49.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's what they believe. They've found
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.88,0:36:52.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}人们相信如此 人们在小行星上 发现了类似于菌丝的结构
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.60,0:36:52.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}mycelial-like structures on asteroids
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.32,0:36:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and bits of debris from space.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.32,0:36:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还有太空的残骸上也有
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.44,0:36:59.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, that means mushrooms are space penises.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.44,0:36:59.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那意味着蘑菇是太空阴茎
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.16,0:37:00.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.16,0:37:00.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 对 - 我不能...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.12,0:37:02.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's how I'm gonna sell them in the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.12,0:37:02.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我打算这么在店里卖
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.80,0:37:05.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}-"Jeremy's Special Space Penises."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.80,0:37:05.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“杰里米的特别太空阴茎”
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.32,0:37:07.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Won't even label them as a mushroom! Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.32,0:37:07.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}甚至都不打标签说这是蘑菇 就...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.40,0:37:09.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Space Penises."
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.40,0:37:09.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“太空阴茎”
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.16,0:37:15.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Having made cuts in the bags for the space penises to grow through,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.16,0:37:15.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在袋子上切开小口 让太空阴茎能长出来之后
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.64,0:37:18.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}we switched on the humidifier
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.64,0:37:21.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们打开了加湿器 让魔法开始
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.96,0:37:21.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and let the magic commence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.32,0:37:26.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a good job. It looks good. Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.32,0:37:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}干得好 看起来不错
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.16,0:37:26.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:34.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I left the bunker pleased that the mushroom men
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.04,0:37:34.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我高高兴兴地离开了地堡
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.44,0:37:37.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}were happy with my setup.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.44,0:37:37.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为蘑菇人对我的设置很满意
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.80,0:37:42.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And the next day, I set about building a pen
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.80,0:37:42.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}第二天 我开始为即将抵达 迪丽斯库阿特农场的
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.44,0:37:47.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}for some new Diddly Squat arrivals.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.44,0:37:47.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}新成员修建围栏
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.92,0:37:49.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're like a week old. They're a week old.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.92,0:37:49.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们差不多一周大
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.84,0:37:50.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.32,0:37:54.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I was very much looking forward to this event.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.32,0:37:54.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我非常期待这一活动
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.00,0:37:56.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Kaleb, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.00,0:37:57.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但卡莱布就没那么期待了
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.96,0:37:57.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}less so.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.60,0:38:00.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Look at the shed space it's using.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.60,0:38:00.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看看它占用的棚屋空间
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.32,0:38:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What? - Look at the shed space it's using.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.32,0:38:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 怎么了? - 看看它占用的棚屋空间
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.68,0:38:05.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Listen, Kaleb. Let me just try and explain something to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.68,0:38:05.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}听着 卡莱布 让我试着跟你解释一下
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.40,0:38:06.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.40,0:38:06.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你说吧
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.84,0:38:08.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The subsidies are going.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.84,0:38:08.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}政府补贴正在削减
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.44,0:38:09.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yes. I'm aware of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.44,0:38:09.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.64,0:38:12.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're going to be replaced with environmental subsidies.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.64,0:38:12.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们将被环境补贴取代
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.36,0:38:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.36,0:38:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.28,0:38:17.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Things like using goats to create more farmland.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.28,0:38:17.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}诸如利用山羊换取更多农田之类的事
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.80,0:38:21.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I've seen these subsidies, yeah? And I've not seen goats on that list.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.80,0:38:21.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我见过这些补贴项目 好吗? 我可没在名单上看到山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.36,0:38:23.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll bet you any money I'll get a grant for the goats.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.36,0:38:23.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟你打赌 我赌山羊能拿到补贴
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.56,0:38:28.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Because I am going to be using goats
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.56,0:38:30.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为我要利用山羊 做通常一台机器做的事...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.48,0:38:30.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}to do what a machine would normally do,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:33.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which will count as environmental farming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:31.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.60,0:38:33.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...这还会被算作环保农业
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.40,0:38:39.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Bottom line: I needed to clear as many brambles as possible
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.40,0:38:39.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}总之 我需要尽可能多地清理
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.64,0:38:41.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}from my unfarmed land.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.64,0:38:41.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我的非耕地上的荆棘
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.00,0:38:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And annoyingly,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.00,0:38:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}令人恼火的是 有很多地方
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.12,0:38:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}there were many areas that WALL-E, my beloved robo-mulcher,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.12,0:38:50.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是我心爱的清理机器“沃利” 够不到的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.68,0:38:50.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}couldn't reach.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.56,0:38:55.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I mean, that's the thickest brambles on the whole farm,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.56,0:38:52.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那超出了...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.84,0:38:55.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那里的荆棘是整个农场里最密集的
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:38:59.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and there's no way I can get in over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.40,0:38:59.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我根本没办法让机器过去
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.60,0:39:02.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, I had had the genius idea
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.60,0:39:04.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因此 我想到了这个天才的点子 买山羊来完成这项工作
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.52,0:39:05.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}of buying goats to do the job,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.16,0:39:08.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}which Kaleb thought was a complete waste of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.16,0:39:08.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而卡莱布认为此举完全是在浪费钱
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.92,0:39:13.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how much these thirty goats were?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.92,0:39:13.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道30头山羊多少钱吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.12,0:39:14.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How much? - A tenner each?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.12,0:39:14.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 多少钱? - 每只10英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.48,0:39:16.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£300. A tenner each.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.48,0:39:16.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 总共300英镑 每只10英镑 - 对
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.20,0:39:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£10.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.20,0:39:18.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 10英镑 - 他们应该免费给你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.16,0:39:19.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They should be giving you for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.40,0:39:20.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a tenner!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.40,0:39:20.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}10英镑而已!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.52,0:39:23.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}To make any money, you should be having them for free.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.52,0:39:23.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}为了赚更多钱 你应该不花钱就买到山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.60,0:39:25.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll tell you what. I can make money out of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.60,0:39:25.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我跟你们说 我可以用它们赚钱
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.48,0:39:27.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do a little petting place up at the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.48,0:39:27.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 在商店里做个小宠物区 - 花10英镑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:31.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- A tenner to spend 15 minutes with them. - Talk about bloody hobby farming!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.96,0:39:31.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 就能跟它们玩20分钟 - 靠爱好搞农业的就是不行
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.04,0:39:32.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Dear God! I'd make money, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.04,0:39:32.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天啊 - 但我能赚到钱
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.36,0:39:35.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- It's a thousand-acre farm! You want-- No, it's not.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.36,0:39:35.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是400公顷的农场 如果你想拿出八公顷作为爱好用...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.28,0:39:38.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Your bit is only 500 acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.28,0:39:38.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 不是 你的农场只有200公顷
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.00,0:39:39.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}My bit is 500 acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.00,0:39:42.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我负责的地有200公顷 但其中198公顷都被荆棘覆盖
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.76,0:39:42.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And about 490 of them are covered in brambles.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.60,0:39:46.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Put the goats in the brambles, we create more farmland.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.60,0:39:46.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}把山羊放进荆棘丛里 就能创造更多农田
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.04,0:39:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- I can't get the machine. Use that machine. You love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.04,0:39:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那你就用机器啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.64,0:39:51.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I showed you, you can't get--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.64,0:39:51.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你喜欢那机器! - 我没法用机器...我给你看过
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.00,0:39:53.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'll lift it in there for you with the telehandler.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.00,0:39:53.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我会用伸缩臂叉车帮你把它抬进去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.28,0:39:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}The telehandler--
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.28,0:39:54.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会用伸缩臂叉车吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:55.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a bit late now. The goats are coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.36,0:39:57.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在讨论为时已晚 山羊要来了 所以你们俩闭嘴吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:55.88,0:39:57.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just shush, the both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.80,0:39:59.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}We've got to get this working.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.80,0:40:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们得把这玩意安好 它们现在只喝牛奶
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.60,0:40:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're just on milk at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.00,0:40:03.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How many, er, goats? Thirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.00,0:40:03.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 多少只山羊? - 30只
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.00,0:40:05.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They have to be trained to use this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.00,0:40:05.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们必须经过训练才会用这机器 - 得适者生存
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.00,0:40:07.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Survival of the fittest. - How do you teach a goat to use an app
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.00,0:40:07.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么教山羊用应用程序? 或者用电脑?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.92,0:40:10.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- or that computer program? That's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.92,0:40:10.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 - 那是给你的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.04,0:40:12.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You just... So you put the milk powder in the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.04,0:40:12.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你把奶粉放在上面 - 这里 我们把它插进去吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.80,0:40:14.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's the milk powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.80,0:40:14.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那是奶粉
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.08,0:40:16.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how much that is a bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.08,0:40:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们知道每袋多少钱吗? - 天啊 每袋多少钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.84,0:40:18.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, God. How much is a bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.84,0:40:18.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们知道多少...你们猜猜多少钱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.84,0:40:21.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Have a guess how much is a bag. 40 quid? 50 quid?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.84,0:40:21.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}40英镑?50英镑?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.16,0:40:23.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- No, it isn't? 60 quid?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.16,0:40:23.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不对 - 60英镑?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:24.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}80 quid? - 70.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.00,0:40:24.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 80英镑? - 什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.84,0:40:26.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- 70 quid? - That's 70 quid?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.84,0:40:25.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 70英镑 - 70?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.84,0:40:26.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那个居然要70英镑?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.04,0:40:28.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.56,0:40:29.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And you're telling me
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.56,0:40:29.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 而你还跟我说你会赚钱? - 这玩意很贵
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.80,0:40:32.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- you're gonna make money? - It's expensive kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.80,0:40:32.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我在开辟土地
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.00,0:40:32.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm creating land.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.84,0:40:38.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Just as we finished getting everything ready...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.84,0:40:38.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就在我们把所有东西都准备好时...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.60,0:40:40.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.60,0:40:40.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}山羊!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.20,0:40:43.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...Lizzie, the goat lady, arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.20,0:40:43.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}...山羊夫人莉齐来了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.08,0:40:44.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Good morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.08,0:40:44.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}早上好 那么 30只山羊
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.40,0:40:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So, thirty goats. Kids. Just for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.40,0:40:47.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 很好 - 羊羔 这是给你们的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.80,0:40:50.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So we're this side, we're this side. Jockey door.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.80,0:40:50.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以我们在这边 开门
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.28,0:40:54.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Oh, my God. Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.28,0:40:54.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 天啊 看看它们 - 所以...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.92,0:40:58.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Before we could unload, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.92,0:41:01.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但在我们卸货前 莉齐必须把挤奶机装好
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.76,0:41:01.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Lizzie had to set the milking machine up.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.80,0:41:04.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, so you've gotta push the teats through.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.80,0:41:04.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 所以你得把 这些奶嘴推到那边 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.12,0:41:05.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That side. Yeah. One red... And then--
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.12,0:41:07.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一个红的 然后一个白的 - 然后 放...对 我记得
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.60,0:41:07.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then put it in, yeah. And then one white.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.64,0:41:10.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you'll do the same on that side and the same over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.64,0:41:10.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后你要在那边做同样的事 那边也是一样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.48,0:41:12.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. That's that.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.48,0:41:12.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 就是那样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.04,0:41:14.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can you put that one on? That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.04,0:41:14.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你已经把那个装好了 很完美
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.28,0:41:17.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then you just need to put your bag of milk powder in the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.28,0:41:17.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后 你只需要把奶粉 装进上面的容器里
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.28,0:41:19.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}£70 a bag of milk powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.28,0:41:19.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 倒进去 - 70英镑一袋的奶粉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.48,0:41:21.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It is like liquid gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.48,0:41:21.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像液体黄金一样
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.16,0:41:24.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You will be very protective of your milk powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.16,0:41:24.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你会想保护好你的奶粉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.20,0:41:25.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Go on there now.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.20,0:41:25.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在进去
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.68,0:41:29.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}What it does is it releases a certain amount of milk powder
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.68,0:41:29.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它的作用是将一定量的奶粉
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.28,0:41:30.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- to a certain amount of warm water. And so it's demand and supply?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.28,0:41:30.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}释放到一定量的温水中
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.92,0:41:33.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. And it's ad lib.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.92,0:41:33.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 这就是需求和供应 - 对 不需要事先准备
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.44,0:41:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And as soon as it gets to a certain point, it automatically refills.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.44,0:41:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一旦到达某个点 它会自动补充
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.80,0:41:39.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And there's a pump in there as well, obviously?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.80,0:41:39.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}显然 里面还有一个泵
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.88,0:41:40.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no pump.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.88,0:41:40.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不 没有泵 - 那就是它们吸
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.84,0:41:43.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- So it's just them sucking? - Yeah. And it's gravity.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.84,0:41:43.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对 还有重力作用
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.36,0:41:46.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, they're gonna have to be Linda Lovelace to suck it that far.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.36,0:41:46.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们得像琳达洛夫莱丝 才能吸那么远
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.36,0:41:47.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.64,0:41:49.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And how long will one bag last us?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.64,0:41:49.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一包奶粉能吃多久?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.04,0:41:53.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With thirty kids at this age, you're gonna be at least a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.04,0:41:53.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}30只这个年龄的小山羊 至少要喝一天
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.56,0:41:56.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- They won't drink, you know, too much. - A day?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.56,0:41:56.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 它们喝得不太多 - 一天?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.28,0:41:58.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A day? I thought you were gonna say 3 weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.28,0:41:58.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一天?我以为你会说三周 一天?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.52,0:42:00.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- That would be wishful thinking. - A day?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.52,0:42:00.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}那可真是痴心妄想
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:02.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- We normally-- £70 a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.20,0:42:02.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一天居然要70英镑吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.76,0:42:06.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can I ask you a really big favour? Don't tell Kaleb.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.76,0:42:06.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我能请你帮个大忙吗? 别告诉卡莱布
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.76,0:42:08.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's a need-to-know basis.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.76,0:42:08.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不会跟他多说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.88,0:42:10.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}With all the housekeeping done,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.88,0:42:13.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所有杂务都已完成 是时候享受美好时光了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.92,0:42:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}it was now time for the good bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.52,0:42:15.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Hello, goats!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.52,0:42:15.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你们好 山羊 - 这些是大的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.56,0:42:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Those are big ones. - Welcome to Diddly Squat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.56,0:42:18.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}欢迎来到迪丽斯库阿特农场
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.60,0:42:21.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- There we go. How old are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.60,0:42:21.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 进去吧 - 它们多大?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.28,0:42:23.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Two weeks old. Two weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.28,0:42:23.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 两周 - 两周?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.52,0:42:27.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You are stunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.52,0:42:27.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.52,0:42:34.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ready? Look at your new house!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.52,0:42:34.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗?看看你的新家
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.92,0:42:37.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Have they been castrated?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.92,0:42:37.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们已经绝育了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.80,0:42:39.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They have been castrated, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.80,0:42:39.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}没错 已经绝育了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.28,0:42:42.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's just brilliant being an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.28,0:42:42.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}做动物真是太棒了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.60,0:42:45.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"Oh, you're a man? We'll have your bollocks off."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.60,0:42:45.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}哦 你是公的? 我们会帮你除掉蛋蛋的
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.76,0:42:48.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}"But I might need them?" "No, you won't."
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.76,0:42:48.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}“但我可能需要蛋蛋” 不 你不需要
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.04,0:42:51.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Last two, right? There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.04,0:42:51.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}最后两只 好吗?好了
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.32,0:42:54.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Right. Look at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.32,0:42:56.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好的 看看它们 太可爱了 它们在吃奶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:54.36,0:42:56.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They're adorable. And this lot are eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.76,0:42:59.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. So that's what you want. They're up, they're drinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.76,0:42:59.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊 这就是你想要的 它们起来喝奶
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.32,0:43:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And it's not survival of the fittest?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.32,0:43:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这不是适者生存
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.04,0:43:03.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no. They know what they're doing. They all know how to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.04,0:43:03.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 不是 它们知道自己在做什么 - 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.08,0:43:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}How can we stop them drinking as much as they are drinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.08,0:43:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们都知道怎么喝奶
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.52,0:43:09.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}'Cause it's incredibly expensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.52,0:43:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么能阻止它们尽情喝奶呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.16,0:43:09.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为这非常昂贵
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.16,0:43:14.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Observe. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.16,0:43:14.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}看啊 快
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.12,0:43:15.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}That's a good sign. They're drinking already.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.12,0:43:15.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是个好迹象 它们已经开始喝奶了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.80,0:43:16.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.80,0:43:18.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 是啊 - 你知道它们喝多少吗 卡莱布?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.80,0:43:18.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Do you know how much they drink, Kaleb?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.40,0:43:20.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, for C-- What are you--
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.40,0:43:21.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你怎么...你为什么要告诉他?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.40,0:43:21.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Why are you telling him that?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.96,0:43:25.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}K, how many bags a week do you think we're gonna get through?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.96,0:43:25.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}好吧 你觉得 我们一周会需要多少袋?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.28,0:43:27.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I dunno. Two bags a week?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.28,0:43:27.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我不知道 一周两袋?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.60,0:43:29.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Seven...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.60,0:43:29.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 一周七袋 - 两袋?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.04,0:43:29.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.92,0:43:33.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So they're in here for two months.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.92,0:43:33.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以它们要在这里待两个月
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.32,0:43:35.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They normally say twelve weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.32,0:43:35.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 然后... - 通常的说法是12周
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.16,0:43:39.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ours normally, we normally start weaning them at ten weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.16,0:43:39.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我们通常在第十周开始给它们断奶
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.08,0:43:40.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}if they get a good start.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.08,0:43:40.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}如果它们情况不错的话...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.68,0:43:44.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So ten weeks and they'll eat brambles?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.68,0:43:44.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以十周 它们可以...它们会吃荆棘
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.12,0:43:45.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}They will eat pretty much anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.12,0:43:45.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}它们几乎什么都吃
