Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.68,0:47:53.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, you haven't got the all-clear yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.68,0:47:53.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}还没有全部消除
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.36,0:47:55.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, you know, touch wood.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.36,0:47:55.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你知道吗?祈求好运吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.52,0:47:58.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I can't even get my head round it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.52,0:47:58.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我甚至都无法理解
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.64,0:48:00.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So what was it... Did you have a catheter, then, for--?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.64,0:48:00.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以到底是怎么回事? 你用导管来...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.84,0:48:02.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.84,0:48:02.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}对...但你不用把它取下来
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.08,0:48:07.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}...that keeps going.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.08,0:48:07.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}丢掉 然后再...插回去 需要放进去
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.04,0:48:09.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You gotta do it yourself. I calls them pints...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.04,0:48:08.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你必须自己动手
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.40,0:48:11.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}因为它们的颜色 我叫它们品脱 再放另一个
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.36,0:48:14.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So the thing's here, so you've got that big round mushroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.36,0:48:14.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这东西就像一个大雨蘑菇
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.72,0:48:17.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}When that's whizzling round, now, you've gotta...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.72,0:48:17.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}现在吹口哨的时候 你会...它有点...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.52,0:48:20.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's got a tea pot in or something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.52,0:48:20.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像里面有个茶壶之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.36,0:48:22.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}And then a pad for like, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.36,0:48:22.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}然后装满了深色液体
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.84,0:48:24.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}like the dark ones that was there one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.84,0:48:24.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}有一天 它就在那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.12,0:48:27.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Doink, doink, doink, doink, doink, doink, doink.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:30.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}This is the best description of cancer treatment I've ever heard I think!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.36,0:48:30.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这是我听过的对于癌症治疗 最棒的描述
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.56,0:48:33.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.56,0:48:33.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.56,0:48:37.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You've no idea how much we've all missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.56,0:48:37.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不知道我们所有人都有多想你
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.64,0:48:39.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It must be nice to be back on a day like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.64,0:48:39.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在像今天这样的日子回来一定很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.84,0:48:41.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:39.84,0:48:41.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.16,0:48:43.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's nice being back to see all my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.16,0:48:43.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很高兴回来看到我所有的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.52,0:48:44.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.52,0:48:44.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.52,0:48:46.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}So that's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.52,0:48:46.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}所以这就是为什么...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.64,0:48:48.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like mowing grass with a mower, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.64,0:48:48.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这就像用割草机割草 不是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.68,0:48:51.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You can't go...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.68,0:48:53.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你不能挑出部分和箭头 还有程序和一切
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.36,0:48:53.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}... with the programme and everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.04,0:48:55.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Er, well, you can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.04,0:48:55.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你可以...但你知道...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.12,0:48:56.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.44,0:48:59.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Well, I just think... You know, with... Well, I don't know...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.44,0:49:01.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我只是觉得... 我不知道...但是...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.92,0:49:00.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Yeah. But--
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.00,0:49:02.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}No, no, no. That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.00,0:49:02.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}不 那话没错
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.44,0:49:05.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It's like a nozzle on the end of a watering can.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.44,0:49:05.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}就像末端有一个喷口 这样水就能流出来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.44,0:49:15.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}A lot of the time, farming is brutal and hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.44,0:49:15.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}很多时候 务农残酷而艰辛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.68,0:49:20.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Ain't nothin' wrong with this chemistry ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.84,0:49:24.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But at this time of year when everything is vivid,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.84,0:49:24.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但今年的这个时候 当一切都生机勃勃 健康成长
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.28,0:49:26.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and growing, and bursting with life
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.28,0:49:26.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}孕育新生
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.20,0:49:28.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}and everyone is well...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.20,0:49:28.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}而且大家都健康时
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.48,0:49:34.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}It can be the best job in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.48,0:49:34.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}这可能是世界上最好的工作
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.24,0:49:35.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Is another one meant for me ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.12,0:49:38.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ To tell me now ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.24,0:49:41.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ And show me how ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.60,0:49:43.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ To understand ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.64,0:49:46.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ What makes a good man? ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.76,0:49:49.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}♪ Tell me now... ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.92,0:49:51.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}On the surface, then,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.92,0:49:51.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}田地地面上
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.28,0:49:54.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Diddly Squat was a green and happy place
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.28,0:49:55.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}在我们步入夏季之时 迪丽斯库阿特绿意盎然、充满快乐
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.24,0:49:56.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}as we headed into summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.36,0:50:00.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}But underground,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.36,0:50:00.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}但在地下
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.00,0:50:04.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}an alien life form was gathering an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.00,0:50:04.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}一个外星生命体正在集结军队
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.92,0:50:11.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}下一集
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.64,0:50:14.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Can I interest you in the new Diddly Squat range?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.64,0:50:14.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}让我介绍一下迪丽斯库阿特农场 推出的新产品
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.32,0:50:15.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}You're selling space penises?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:14.32,0:50:15.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}你们在卖“太空阴茎”?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.60,0:50:16.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}太空阴茎 只限今日!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.84,0:50:19.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I cannot tell you how good they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.84,0:50:19.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}我无法描述它们的味道有多好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.48,0:50:21.84,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}6.1 kilos.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.48,0:50:21.84,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}6.1千克
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.52,0:50:23.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.52,0:50:23.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}准备好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.40,0:50:25.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}- Kaleb! How are you? - How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.40,0:50:25.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 卡莱布 你好吗? - 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.52,0:50:26.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1000)}I'm very well, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.52,0:50:26.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1070)}- 你还好吗? - 我很好
